#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:1
#: a312938474574cf985abf56da6952e4a
msgid "最大误差结构：先复核，再决定删不删"
msgstr "Largest-Error Structures: Inspect Before Deleting"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:3
#: c0998e2371db4633b36ac18a8726ac26
msgid ""
"`Find Max Error Point` 用来快速定位当前图上误差最大的结构。高误差不等于坏数"
"据：它也可能表示训练集缺少这一类结构。正确顺序是先选中、看结构和 "
"`Config_type`，再决定重新计算、保留补强或删除。"
msgstr ""
"`Find Max Error Point` quickly locates the structures with the largest "
"errors on the current plot. A large error does not necessarily mean bad "
"data; it may show that the training set lacks this type of structure. Select "
"the points, inspect the structures and `Config_type`, then decide whether to "
"recalculate, retain and reinforce, or delete them."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:5
#: 9564a71d63404f9282d7798850f854e1
msgid "1. 先激活要检查的图"
msgstr "1. Activate the plot you want to inspect"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:7
#: 519d474a069443afbdc464027ff38c22
msgid ""
"打开训练结果后，双击要检查的小图，使它进入主图区。本例检查 `energy`；如果要找"
"力误差最大的结构，应先激活 `force` 图。"
msgstr ""
"After opening the training results, double-click the thumbnail you want to "
"inspect so it enters the main plot. This example checks `energy`; to find "
"the structures with the largest force errors, activate the `force` plot "
"first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:9
#: b7e1ce6717dc47b0a09f4a49c8274789
msgid "激活能量图并打开最大误差筛选"
msgstr "Activate the energy plot and open the largest-error selector"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:9
#: b7e1ce6717dc47b0a09f4a49c8274789
msgid ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/max_error_review_entry.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/max_error_review_entry.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:14
#: 033da04ea9714091b0f7e268e6b0da72
msgid ""
"点击 `Find Max Error Point`。这个按钮只针对当前主图，不会同时混合 energy、"
"force、stress 和 virial 的误差。"
msgstr ""
"Click `Find Max Error Point`. This action applies only to the current main "
"plot; it does not combine errors from energy, force, stress, and virial."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:16
#: f28c20ef3dd2426585d85571d3a264aa
msgid "2. 输入要复核的结构数"
msgstr "2. Enter the number of structures to review"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:18
#: 2c1f4521df794053b58db66d5d1fa918
msgid "最大误差结构数量设置"
msgstr "Number of largest-error structures to select"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:18
#: 2c1f4521df794053b58db66d5d1fa918
msgid ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_maxerr_dialog.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_maxerr_dialog.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:23
#: d5c90837c48e4c378d09c959b29701f1
msgid ""
"第一次可以先填 `5`。数量太大时容易失去重点；先看最极端的几个，确认问题类型后"
"再扩大范围。"
msgstr ""
"Start with `5`. A large selection makes it harder to focus. Review the most "
"extreme cases first, identify the problem type, and then expand the "
"selection if needed."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:25
#: d54f3f65de1143b78dcd63425f2481a2
msgid "3. 逐个判断误差来源"
msgstr "3. Determine the source of each error"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:27
#: 23191137e2b74b7e8fd566b939ae6fc2
msgid "选中的五个最大能量误差结构"
msgstr "Five selected structures with the largest energy errors"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:27
#: 23191137e2b74b7e8fd566b939ae6fc2
msgid ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/max_error_review_result.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/max_error_review_result.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:32
#: ca00d4376e934c09aebfc8e151ced2ce
msgid ""
"本例底部状态栏显示 `Sel: 5`。依次点击选中点，重点看右侧结构、`Config_type` 和"
"原始文件序号："
msgstr ""
"The status bar in this example shows `Sel: 5`. Click the selected points one "
"by one and inspect the structure on the right, its `Config_type`, and its "
"source-file index:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:34
#: e00fd8a03cf5474f8067ffd893a97626
msgid ""
"结构合理、标签可信：通常应保留，并检查这一类构型是否在训练集中覆盖不足；"
msgstr ""
"Reasonable structure and trustworthy label: usually retain it and check "
"whether this configuration type is underrepresented in the training set."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:35
#: e8119d40005a43ecb70e05529b985dc2
msgid "结构合理但 DFT 未收敛或标签异常：回到原计算重新检查，不要直接拿去重训；"
msgstr ""
"Reasonable structure but unconverged DFT or an abnormal label: return to the "
"original calculation and inspect it; do not use it directly for retraining."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:36
#: dcea585fd4504542b3d2b657e4334ede
msgid ""
"结构明显破坏、原子重叠或来源错误：确认后再删除，或者先 `Export Selected` 单独"
"留档。"
msgstr ""
"Clearly broken structure, overlapping atoms, or incorrect provenance: delete "
"it only after confirmation, or use `Export Selected` to archive it "
"separately first."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/maximum-error-review.md:38
#: 971eebc05c7548e6bacf152db03dd98b
msgid ""
"不要把“删除最大误差点”当成降低 RMSE 的固定步骤。未经复核地删除，可能正好删掉"
"模型最需要补学的区域。"
msgstr ""
"Do not treat deleting the largest-error points as a routine way to reduce "
"RMSE. Deleting them without review may remove exactly the region the model "
"most needs to learn."
